  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Weapon Attachment (requires firearm without the Scatter or Mounted properties)</strong></p><p>As an action, you can attach or detach a silencer to a firearm that does not have the Scatter or Mounted properties. While the silencer is attached to a firearm, it significantly muffles the sound of the gunshot, but dampens the velocity of the projectile. Ranged weapon attacks with a firearm with a silencer attached can only be heard from 40 feet away, but the firearm's normal range is halved.</p>",
